{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 家常烹饪 (home cooking), focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. Explicitly NOT interested in restaurant business operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n- Working set: 200 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The interest explicitly states: \"关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理，不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销\" (focus on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles; NOT interested in restaurant operations or kitchen appliance promotions).\n\nLooking at the candidates, I can identify several content types:\n1. **概念速览** (concept overview) - lists common concepts, provides question catalog\n2. **操作记录** (operation records) - gives ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, batch comparisons, adjustment steps → this matches \"可复现做法\" (reproducible methods)\n3. **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - explains how moisture, temperature, food structure affect texture → this matches \"烹饪原理\" (cooking principles)\n4. **专题观察** (special topic observation) - introduces local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories → this is more cultural/historical, less about reproducible cooking\n5. **市场观察** (market observation) - analyzes restaurant chain locations, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, kitchen appliance discounts → this matches what the user is NOT interested in (餐饮门店经营 or 厨电促销)\n\nSo I should EXCLUDE the \"市场观察\" (market observation) candidates since they directly contradict the user's explicit preference against restaurant operations and kitchen appliance promotions.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) candidates focus on local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories - these are less aligned with the user's focus on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. They're tangential.\n\nThe best matches for the user's interest are:\n- **操作记录** (operation records) - reproducible methods\n- **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - cooking principles\n- **概念速览** (concept overview) - provides question catalog for further reading\n\nLet me count the candidates by type to understand the pool. Given the target is 20, I need to select 20 candidates.\n\nLet me focus on the candidates that best match the user's interest. The user wants reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. So I should prioritize:\n1. 操作记录 (operation records) - directly reproducible\n2. 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - cooking principles\n3. 概念速览 (concept overview) - provides question catalog\n\nAnd exclude 市场观察 (market observation) entirely.\n\nLet me identify the operation records and conditions/principles candidates. There are many dishes: 煎豆腐, 煎饺, 米饭含水量, 清汤调味, 蒸鱼, 番茄炒蛋, 鸡胸肉口感, 面团发酵, 炖牛肉, 蔬菜焯水.\n\nLet me select a balanced set across dishes and content types (operation records and conditions/principles primarily).\n\nLet me identify the operation record candidates (操作记录):\n- item-024e99402549: 煎饺 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-02ec789dd9bf: 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-085ac75e2f6f: 煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-1635bae1e58d: 米饭含水量 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5: 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-2062e507d111: 蒸鱼 两人晚餐 操作记录\n- item-2802591dd8c9: 蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-342993e68175: 炖牛肉 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-41f1925e3d74: 米饭含水量 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-4736b753745c: 煎饺 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-47ec3b435037: 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 操作记录\n- item-52c20cae5610: 蔬菜焯水 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-52719ddc4224: 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐 操作记录\n- item-58677ff38120: 面团发酵 小份试做 操作记录\n- item-5dfd02cf6e3a: 清汤调味 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-693e18a58e5e: 清汤调味 小份试做 操作记录\n- item-726c16fe5955: 鸡胸肉口感 小份试做 操作记录\n- item-76a48bfcc5ba: 煎饺 小份试做 操作记录\n- item-793b229f835d: 鸡胸肉口感 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-79ea9990101c: 煎豆腐 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-7bd0e2754de2: 炖牛肉 小份试做 操作记录\n- item-7e57e95a49ff: 蒸鱼 工作日备餐 操作记录\n- item-9419f186455e: 鸡胸肉口感 两人晚餐 操作记录\n- 